OL,3,AUK needs new laws for AI in healthcare,
OL,4,Asays watchdog
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK needs new regulations for AI
OL,7,Fproducts used in the NHS and other
OL,8,Fhealthcare settings, says Britain's
OL,9,Findustry watchdog.
OL,11,FThe Medicines and Healthcare Products
OL,12,FRegulatory Agency (MHRA), which
OL,13,Fregulates all medical devices and
OL,14,Flicenses treatment drugs in the UK, has
OL,15,Fpublished 44 recommendations to update
OL,16,Fits policies as the use of AI in the
OL,17,Fsector rises.
OL,19,FThe technology will soon be routinely
OL,20,Fused within the NHS, MHRA chief
OL,21,FLawrence Tallon told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
