OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AGoogle picks Finland for its largest
OL,4,Asingle investment in Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is Google's largest single
OL,7,Finvestment in Europe and a testament to
OL,8,FFinland's leadership in responsibly
OL,9,Fbuilding AI infrastructure," the
OL,10,Fcompany said on Wednesday.
OL,12,F"Google's decision is a clear testament
OL,13,Fto our strengths," Finland's Prime
OL,14,FMinister Petteri Orpo said in a
OL,15,Fstatement.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
