OL,3,ANicolas Cage's driveway collapses as
OL,4,Asinkhole opens up at his Malibu home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large sinkhole has opened up up
OL,7,Foutside a house in Malibu reportedly
OL,8,Fbelonging to Hollywood actor Nicolas
OL,9,FCage.
OL,11,FThe sinkhole, estimated to be 30ft
OL,12,F(9.1m) by 30ft, appeared after the
OL,13,Fdriveway collapsed and follows heavy
OL,14,Frain in southern California over recent
OL,15,Fdays.
OL,17,FLocal media said that no injuries had
OL,18,Fbeen reported. BBC News has asked
OL,19,Frepresentatives for Cage for comment.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
